From 769e9a8858b138a4258e4e8b497cbd0444817b26 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 04:37:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(theme): one deck theme for every section

Read the hero DAW and the About glass hardware into app/deck-theme.css
(ground, paper, signals, three type roles, shape, shell material) and point
the hero, bench, bridge and rack palettes at it. Re-skin the Skills
controller and Experience radio in the About device's language, put
Experience/divider on the About's graph paper, align Work shell and Contact
radii.
